ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhou Li and Lin Tao are rival singers. At a music awards ceremony, Zhou Li publicly announces that she is about to collaborate with an internationally renowned singer, even though this collaboration has not been finalized yet. Lin Tao feels that his position in the music industry is threatened and, unwilling to be outdone, also announces that his new album will be produced by a world-class producer, even though this is only a preliminary discussion.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Lin Tao announce that his new album is produced by a world-class producer?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Lin Tao tries to enhance his fame through a fictitious collaboration, in response to Zhou Li's announcement.\nB. Lin Tao disdains Zhou Li's ability to collaborate with an international singer.\nC. Lin Tao hopes to reach a cooperation with a world-class producer by making the announcement.\nD. Lin Tao indeed reaches a cooperation with a world-class producer.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006902038392987,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e416d6006945d2806fa8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368534989,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:42:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"953759c88272446dbd7f6658a7b8eb7a"}